block vars
	- var active = 'Index'
	- var bodyClass = ''

extends templates/layout

block outlet
	h2 About

	p Lp/EP Finder is a vinyl search engine that helps you find the vinyls you are looking for in record shops arround the world or close to you.
	p Please if you have a record store you would like to see integrated to the search engine, <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Yy9u8DkxKwW3D-UbYEJv_90t2-DwUG_PC7nmIp13e8Y/viewform" target="_blank">don't hesitate to submit it!</a>. We usually review the store and add it a couple of days later.
	p Also, your <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1k8PKJ9KsjmJe5COe5PMpIMMWapY9qPbRC6Ds8n4V1XI/viewform" target="_blank">feedback</a> on any aspect of Lp/Ep Finder is deeply apreciated!


	h2 Social networks

	p You can find us on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/pages/LpEp-Finder/794497917261632" target="_blank">Facebook</a> and also <a href="https://plus.google.com/+Lpepfindervinyl" target="_blank">Google+</a>


	h2 Selected vinyl stores

	p If you feel like a record store is missing <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Yy9u8DkxKwW3D-UbYEJv_90t2-DwUG_PC7nmIp13e8Y/viewform" target="_blank">please submit it!</a>

